OL,3,GNEWSAToxic waste sites exposed in
OL,4,AMichael Sheen documentary are 'tip of
OL,5,Athe iceberg'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former Monsanto worker who spent
OL,8,Fthree years helping seal toxic waste
OL,9,Funderground said staff had "cheap"
OL,10,Fprotective equipment and were not told
OL,11,Fwhat they were burying.
OL,13,FStephen Constance worked at the
OL,14,Fchemical giant's Newport factory in the
OL,15,F1990s and came forward after the BBC
OL,16,Fdocumentary Buried with Michael Sheen
OL,17,Fhighlighted Wales' toxic waste legacy.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
