OL,3,GNEWSAToxic waste sites exposed in
OL,4,AMichael Sheen documentary are 'tip of
OL,5,Athe iceberg'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the 14 sites identified in the
OL,8,Fprogramme are just the tip of the
OL,9,Ficeberg and there are about 20,000
OL,10,Fhigh-concern sites in the UK, said Dr
OL,11,FDavid Megson, the scientist involved in
OL,12,Fthe documentary.
OL,14,FEastman Chemical Company, which is
OL,15,Fresponsible for Monsanto's legacy
OL,16,Fproduction in the UK, did not respond
OL,17,Fwhen asked to comment.
